IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. DNS-TUNNEL-SIMULATOR.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  SIMULATED-PACKET-SIZE    PIC 9(4) VALUE 1200.
01  DNS-MAX-PAYLOAD          PIC 9(4) VALUE 512.
01  NUM-SEGMENTS             PIC 9(4).
01  I                           PIC 9(4).
01  CURRENT-SEGMENT-SIZE     PIC 9(4).
01  REMAINING-DATA           PIC 9(4).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "--- SIMULATEUR DE FRAGMENTATION DNS ---"
    MOVE SIMULATED-PACKET-SIZE TO REMAINING-DATA
    MOVE 0 TO NUM-SEGMENTS
    
    PERFORM UNTIL REMAINING-DATA <= 0
        IF REMAINING-DATA > DNS-MAX-PAYLOAD
            MOVE DNS-MAX-PAYLOAD TO CURRENT-SEGMENT-SIZE
        ELSE
            MOVE REMAINING-DATA TO CURRENT-SEGMENT-SIZE
        END-IF
        
        ADD 1 TO NUM-SEGMENTS
        SUBTRACT CURRENT-SEGMENT-SIZE FROM REMAINING-DATA
        
        DISPLAY "Segment " NUM-SEGMENTS ": " CURRENT-SEGMENT-SIZE " bytes"
    END-PERFORM
    
    DISPLAY "---------------------------------------"
    DISPLAY "Total segments DNS requis: " NUM-SEGMENTS
    IF NUM-SEGMENTS > 5
        DISPLAY "ALERTE: Fragmentation trop elevee - Risque de detection"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "STATUS: Fragmentation acceptable"
    END-IF
    
    STOP RUN.